; ---- Vigil Book (font 'vigil/book'): the body face for short UI text (labels, list rows, buttons,
; tooltips, numbers in panels). Lower case with a 5 px x-height and 7 px ascenders, capitals and
; tabular digits 7 tall, on the same 7-row cell and baseline as Vigil, so the two set side by side
; on one grid. There is no room below the baseline: g j p q y keep their tails inside the cell, the
; bowl raised (as on a scribe's ruled line). Glyphs are 1-5 px wide plus 1 px tracking; word space
; 3 px. Long prose (event texts, the pedia) stays in the system serif.
